<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="53169da3">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product defines the data requirements to execute the test effort. Examples of requirements to address test
    data needs include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Will production or synthetic data be used?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        How much data is needed?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        When is the data needed?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Where does the data need to be located?&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Note: Justifications for using production or synthetic data are usually provided.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
